    ns28:StarLayerGraph._before_and_delta_for dcterms:identifier "starlayer.graph.graph.starlayer_graph.StarLayerGraph._before_and_delta_for" ;
        a ns2:Method ;
        rdfs:comment """Dispatch to the right reasoning engine for `regimes`.

    The owlrl-backed combinations (RDFS/OWL-RDF-Based/both together) go
    through _infer_before_and_delta() above; {ENTAILMENT["OWL-Direct"]}
    goes through one of two genuinely different tableau-DL bridges -
    owl_dl.py (HermiT, via owlready2, engine="hermit", the default) or
    owl_dl_rustdl.py (RustDL, engine="rustdl") - chosen by `engine`,
    which is otherwise meaningless (anything but OWL-Direct never even
    looks at it). `timeout` is likewise only meaningful for OWL-Direct -
    see infer()'s own docstring; `None` unambiguously means "disable the
    timeout" here, not "use the engine's own default" (the default *is*
    `_OWL_DL_TIMEOUT_DEFAULT`, a real value, not a sentinel needing
    translation).

    ENTAILMENT.RDF combines freely with RDFS/OWL-RDF-Based (in any
    subset, including both): the native _infer_rdf_before_and_delta()
    delta is unioned with whatever owlrl-backed delta the remaining
    regime(s) produce, if any. Unioning two independently-sound
    entailment sets can't introduce an incorrect triple, so this is
    safe even though RDFS/OWL-RL's own rules already produce
    everything RDF alone would in practice (confirmed empirically) -
    the union is for completeness/consistency, not because of a gap.
    ENTAILMENT.RDF alone still returns exactly what
    _infer_rdf_before_and_delta() itself returns, unchanged. A
    combination that mixes ENTAILMENT["OWL-Direct"] with anything else
    still falls through to _infer_before_and_delta() below and raises
    ValueError there (no such key in _resolve_owlrl_semantics()'s own
    dict) - OWL-Direct is never combinable, before or after this.""" ;
        rdfs:label "_before_and_delta_for" ;
        ns2:calls ns28:StarLayerGraph._infer_before_and_delta, ns32:classify_owl_dl_rustdl, ns30:classify_owl_dl, ns28:StarLayerGraph._infer_rdf_before_and_delta ;
        ns2:filePath "packages/starlayer/starlayer/graph/graph/starlayer_graph.py" ;
        ns2:hasParameter ns28:StarLayerGraph._before_and_delta_for.param.regimes, ns28:StarLayerGraph._before_and_delta_for.param.timeout, ns28:StarLayerGraph._before_and_delta_for.param.engine ;
        ns2:hasReturnValue ns28:StarLayerGraph._before_and_delta_for.returns ;
        ns2:isPrivate true ;
        ns2:lineEnd 3063 ;
        ns2:lineStart 2990 ;
        ns2:signature "def _before_and_delta_for(self, regimes: frozenset, engine: str='hermit', timeout=_OWL_DL_TIMEOUT_DEFAULT)" .

