        ns2:hasType ns4:builtins.bool .

    ns28:StarLayerGraph.open dcterms:identifier "starlayer.graph.graph.starlayer_graph.StarLayerGraph.open" ;
        a ns2:Method ;
        rdfs:comment """Open a persistent store and rebuild the TripleTerm registry.

    Delegates to rdflib's Graph.open() then scans the store for any
