GRAPH <https://github.com/hidden-graph/starlayer/blob/main/packages/starlayer/tests/shacl/integration/test_evaluate_virtual_values.py> {
    ns97:test_evaluate_virtual_values.py dcterms:identifier "tests.shacl.integration.test_evaluate_virtual_values" ;
        a ns2:Module ;
        rdfs:comment """StarShaclSchema.evaluate() - a third, independent processing mode
    alongside validate() (checks conformance, never mutates) and apply_rules()
    (executes sh:rule, materializes real triples).

    Designed 2026-09-07 in direct conversation: pySHACL has no notion of this
    mode at all - sh:values ("virtual"/on-demand computed properties, per the
    SHACL 1.2 Node Expressions spec's own "Getting Started" framing: "typically
    compute[d] only on demand... do not lead to the creation of triples in the
    data graph") is only ever wired into Shape.value_nodes() (pySHACL's
    constraint-evaluation path), so a caller who just wants to *read* a computed
    value - without validating anything, and without it ever touching a real
    rule - had no way to do that at all before evaluate() existed.

    evaluate() returns a *throwaway* graph: a shape-driven subgraph (every
    property shape's real, stored sh:path values for its own target focus
    nodes - not the whole of data_graph, since 2026-10-07) with every
    sh:values-declared virtual property computed and merged in, for every focus
    node it applies to. The caller's own data_graph is never mutated, and the
    result is documented as not meant to be persisted.""" ;
        rdfs:label "test_evaluate_virtual_values" ;
        ns2:declares ns267:TestDefaultValueFallback, ns267:TestDefaultValueAsNodeExpression, ns267:TestReturnedGraphIsShapeDrivenSubgraph, ns267:TestBasicComputation, ns267:TestIsolationFromApplyRules ;
        ns2:filePath "packages/starlayer/tests/shacl/integration/test_evaluate_virtual_values.py" ;
        ns2:importsModule ns4:rdflib, ns4:pytest .

    ns267:TestBasicComputation dcterms:identifier "tests.shacl.integration.test_evaluate_virtual_values.TestBasicComputation" ;
        a ns2:Class ;
        rdfs:label "TestBasicComputation" ;
        ns2:declares ns267:TestBasicComputation.test_computed_value_appears_in_result, ns267:TestBasicComputation.test_standalone_property_shape_with_its_own_direct_target, ns267:TestBasicComputation.test_multiple_focus_nodes_each_get_their_own_value, ns267:TestBasicComputation.test_complex_path_is_skipped_not_crashed, ns267:TestBasicComputation.test_multivalued_computed_property_becomes_multiple_triples, ns267:TestBasicComputation.test_sh_values_unions_with_a_conflicting_stored_value_not_replaces_it, ns267:TestBasicComputation.test_original_data_graph_never_mutated, ns267:TestBasicComputation.test_no_sh_values_present_is_a_harmless_no_op, ns267:TestBasicComputation.test_falls_back_to_data_graph_as_its_own_shapes_graph ;
        ns2:filePath "packages/starlayer/tests/shacl/integration/test_evaluate_virtual_values.py" ;
        ns2:lineEnd 256 ;
