    ns334:test_mc_introspection.py dcterms:identifier "tests.starontology.manchester_conformance.test_mc_introspection" ;
        a ns2:Module ;
        rdfs:comment """Introspection: do the tree vocabulary, the encoder and the shapes agree with each other?

    These catch the SQE-style gap structurally, without needing a failing input: a ``manch:`` term the
    encoder uses but the ontology does not define, an ontology class nothing can produce, or a snapshot that
    no longer matches the live file.""" ;
        rdfs:label "test_mc_introspection" ;
