    as) was never actually exercised - this chain (``myapp -> mid -> base``)
    has no ``owl:versionIRI`` triple anywhere, so ``mid``'s own
    ``owl:imports base`` is only found by looking it up under the plain
    fetched IRI itself.""" ;
