    ns76:_build_reifier_shape_component.ReifierShapeConstraintComponent dcterms:identifier "starlayer.shacl.native_components._build_reifier_shape_component.ReifierShapeConstraintComponent" ;
        a ns2:Class ;
        rdfs:comment """``sh:reifierShape``/``sh:reificationRequired``: for each value
    node reached via the shape's own ``sh:path`` (must be a simple IRI
    per the spec's own syntax rule for this component), find its
    reifiers (nodes ``r`` such that ``r rdf:reifies <<( focus, path,
    value )>>``) and:

    - if ``sh:reificationRequired`` is true and no reifier exists,
      that's a violation with the triple term as ``sh:value``;
    - if ``sh:reifierShape`` is given, each reifier that fails to
      conform to it is a violation, also with the triple term as
      ``sh:value``.

    Both predicates are declared as this one class's constraint
    parameters, so pySHACL's own ``done_constraints`` de-duplication in
    ``Shape.validate()`` instantiates and evaluates it once even when a
    shape declares both.

    One real wrinkle: ``rdf:reifies`` matches against real RDF-1.2
    triple-term identity, but ``evaluate()`` runs on ``target_graph``
    *after* ``TripleTermAdapter.encode_graph()`` has flattened every
    triple term into a content-addressed URI. This works anyway
    because ``encode_graph()`` returns a
    ``_SparqlAwareEncodedGraph`` (``starlayer.shacl/adapters.py``) carrying a
    back-reference to the exact adapter instance that did the encoding
    (``target_graph._tt_adapter``, built earlier for SPARQL/rules
    wiring) - re-encoding ``(focus, path, value)`` through that same
    adapter/registry reproduces the identical URI ``encode_graph()``
    already assigned when it encountered this triple term as the object
    of a real ``rdf:reifies`` triple in the data, so the lookup matches
    correctly without reconstructing or guessing at adapter state.""" ;
        rdfs:label "ReifierShapeConstraintComponent" ;
        rdfs:subClassOf ns4:pyshacl.constraints.constraint_component.ConstraintComponent ;
        ns2:declares ns76:_build_reifier_shape_component.ReifierShapeConstraintComponent.constraint_parameters, ns76:_build_reifier_shape_component.ReifierShapeConstraintComponent._encode_key, ns76:_build_reifier_shape_component.ReifierShapeConstraintComponent.__init__, ns76:_build_reifier_shape_component.ReifierShapeConstraintComponent.evaluate, ns76:_build_reifier_shape_component.ReifierShapeConstraintComponent.constraint_name ;
        ns2:filePath "packages/starlayer/starlayer/shacl/native_components.py" ;
        ns2:lineEnd 1472 ;
        ns2:lineStart 1353 .

