GRAPH <https://github.com/hidden-graph/starlayer/blob/main/packages/starlayer/tests/sparql/unit/test_dirlang_string_functions.py> {
    ns120:test_dirlang_string_functions.py dcterms:identifier "tests.sparql.unit.test_dirlang_string_functions" ;
        a ns2:Module ;
        rdfs:comment """Verify RDF 1.2 Query sec 17.4.3's "Functions on Strings" family
    (STRLEN/SUBSTR/UCASE/LCASE/STRSTARTS/STRENDS/CONTAINS/STRBEFORE/STRAFTER/
    CONCAT/REGEX/REPLACE/ENCODE_FOR_URI) correctly accept and propagate
    dirLangString ("text"@lang--dir) values, plus the directly-adjacent
    DATATYPE()/hasLANG()/hasLANGDIR()/STRLANGDIR() fixes found alongside them.

    Found 2026-10-13 via a retrospective check of which W3C SPARQL 1.2 suite
    categories this project fetches at all: `lang-basedir` (the category
    covering exactly this function family) was never fetched, and every one
    of these 14 functions turned out to reject a dirLangString value outright
    - rdflib's own stock evalfns all call `operators.string()`, which raises
    for any literal whose datatype isn't `xsd:string`, and a dirLangString is
    internally stored with a non-standard `dirlang:` datatype IRI (see
    `starlayer.graph.model.encoding`). Fixed by routing all 14 (13 here;
    `langMATCHES` needs no fix - see `custom_functions.py`'s own module
    comment) through dedicated custom functions registered in
    `starlayer.graph.query.custom_functions`, intercepted during
    `lower_rdf11._lower_expr`'s own dispatch.

    Execution-level tests throughout (run the real query, compare the actual
    result), not structural/parse-only ones - this package's own documented
    testing discipline (`CLAUDE.md`'s "Testing discipline" section) already
    caught two real bugs this exact shape of gap would otherwise hide.""" ;
        rdfs:label "test_dirlang_string_functions" ;
        ns2:declares ns241:TestConcat, ns241:TestRegexReplaceEncodeForUri, ns241:TestHasLangAndHasLangdirOnNonLiterals, ns241:_select_one, ns241:TestDatatypeUcaseOfDirLangString, ns241:_ask, ns241:TestStrlangdirValidation, ns241:TestArgumentCompatibilityAndPropagation ;
        ns2:filePath "packages/starlayer/tests/sparql/unit/test_dirlang_string_functions.py" ;
        ns2:importsModule ns4:__future__, ns4:rdflib.namespace, ns4:rdflib .

    ns241:TestArgumentCompatibilityAndPropagation dcterms:identifier "tests.sparql.unit.test_dirlang_string_functions.TestArgumentCompatibilityAndPropagation" ;
        a ns2:Class ;
        rdfs:comment """STRSTARTS/STRENDS/CONTAINS/STRBEFORE/STRAFTER's shared
    argument-compatibility table (sec 17.4.3's own intro) and
    SUBSTR/STRBEFORE/STRAFTER/REPLACE/UCASE/LCASE's "same kind as arg1"
    propagation rule - the part of this retrofit most likely to hide a
    subtle bug, so covered directly rather than only through the full
    SELECT-list fixtures below.""" ;
        rdfs:label "TestArgumentCompatibilityAndPropagation" ;
        ns2:declares ns241:TestArgumentCompatibilityAndPropagation.test_strstarts_dirlangstring_same_lang_and_dir_is_compatible, ns241:TestArgumentCompatibilityAndPropagation.test_contains_incompatible_args_is_unbound_not_a_crash, ns241:TestArgumentCompatibilityAndPropagation.test_strlen_of_dirlangstring_counts_codepoints_not_the_tag, ns241:TestArgumentCompatibilityAndPropagation.test_substr_propagates_dirlangstring_kind, ns241:TestArgumentCompatibilityAndPropagation.test_strends_dirlangstring_same_lang_and_dir, ns241:TestArgumentCompatibilityAndPropagation.test_strstarts_dirlangstring_vs_plain_is_compatible, ns241:TestArgumentCompatibilityAndPropagation.test_strafter_propagates_dirlangstring_kind_on_match, ns241:TestArgumentCompatibilityAndPropagation.test_strbefore_no_match_is_plain_empty_literal_not_same_kind, ns241:TestArgumentCompatibilityAndPropagation.test_strstarts_dirlangstring_different_dir_is_not_compatible, ns241:TestArgumentCompatibilityAndPropagation.test_lcase_propagates_langstring_kind, ns241:TestArgumentCompatibilityAndPropagation.test_strbefore_propagates_dirlangstring_kind_on_match, ns241:TestArgumentCompatibilityAndPropagation.test_ucase_propagates_dirlangstring_kind, ns241:TestArgumentCompatibilityAndPropagation.test_substr_two_arg_form_without_length, ns241:TestArgumentCompatibilityAndPropagation.test_contains_dirlangstring_same_lang_and_dir, ns241:TestArgumentCompatibilityAndPropagation.test_strstarts_plain_vs_dirlangstring_is_not_compatible ;
        ns2:filePath "packages/starlayer/tests/sparql/unit/test_dirlang_string_functions.py" ;
        ns2:lineEnd 124 ;
        ns2:lineStart 62 .

