GRAPH <https://github.com/hidden-graph/starlayer/blob/main/packages/starlayer/tests/sparql/unit/test_entailment_rdf.py> {
    ns120:test_entailment_rdf.py dcterms:identifier "tests.sparql.unit.test_entailment_rdf" ;
        a ns2:Module ;
        rdfs:comment """tests/unit/test_entailment_rdf.py

    Coverage for starlayer.sparql.entailment_rdf.rewrite_algebra_for_rdf - the
    query-time RDF entailment rewrite (rdfD2 only - see the module's own
    docstring), independent of StarLayerGraph's own entailment= wiring (see
    packages/graph/tests/unit/test_entailment.py for that end-to-end coverage).

    Per this project's own testing discipline (this package's own CLAUDE.md:
    "any new query/update shape needs an execution-comparison test, not just a
    structural one"), the oracle test compares rewritten-query results against
    rdfD2's own direct definition ("every predicate used anywhere in the
    graph") rather than owlrl.RDFS_Semantics's full closure - see
    test_matches_the_direct_definition_of_rdfD2's own comment for why that
    closure isn't actually a clean oracle for this one isolated rule.""" ;
        rdfs:label "test_entailment_rdf" ;
        ns2:declares ns231:TestScopingBoundary, ns231:TestPredicateIsProperty, ns231:_query ;
        ns2:filePath "packages/starlayer/tests/sparql/unit/test_entailment_rdf.py" ;
        ns2:importsModule ns4:rdflib, ns4:rdflib.plugins.sparql .

    ns231:TestPredicateIsProperty dcterms:identifier "tests.sparql.unit.test_entailment_rdf.TestPredicateIsProperty" ;
        a ns2:Class ;
