        a ns2:Function ;
        rdfs:comment """Best-effort SPARQL-ORDER-BY-compatible comparison key.

    RDFLib's own typed ``Literal`` ordering handles numeric/date/string
    comparison correctly for the common cases; falls back to ``str()`` for
